ね星野～様～。私はあなたに言った...え？怒らないの？なんでこんなに優しいんだ？今日は色々と不幸があったけど\"", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@merrow_shiosaki/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "voice", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1324861, "client_id": 1236199, "vtt_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/8e089ff4-e9df-42bb-9df7-47a4f5afef41?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1774631502&Signature=LXVGhZS1-wY1jzLOeqk45OayQaUi-kLl6mHoSK8QyyoeqcjvpgGAH-ivtg9nlPsuZSgKkH9PMGUly~lJVuRwpkN2FN5XB-QeFpz5SSclmQQtMmgWYrwKwJ76SGPkhNHE7SSmekJPqEn~hXnDi96J0hJJaoKTTOLIlP-YxTk9-6SAbGie7j~DXRZLMl-qTay-R845mA9XBa5kyAuH7LzuUTeLpEzWekK6-oH8XRVcVol6s24LI2RaUGULKYSSTRRxDhZmYJUHeuwROSdEhpW-kV25FMjvU0VdzVKZS8T97diC42IxB6gD-LhHUMehI7jWsYLviSqrue9G-Xs9es2~2g__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1936688248610263040%2F5Kpid3uj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2afc60ed7048cbeb9f430a39a6cfab4", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1936688248610263040%2F5Kpid3uj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2afc60ed7048cbeb9f430a39a6cfab4, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1936688248610263040%2F5Kpid3uj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e82c91648a52662d9245ba901d93fffb 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1936688248610263040%2F5Kpid3uj.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=14f438106d32ee3ee7cb1b2ca832c1fd 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/37b42f20-a787-4f96-8ca9-84685cd45a32?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1774631502&Signature=qsXjgaWzstDb~fY-T6e1rsRS~4tCDLdE0Z7BCpU6fdofhIvS-IHUkXd568